data: {"node":"answer","run":"f91ea4dc2dfe7820cd3523642391e2ce","text":"Re-ice the container at the nearest hub now — don't wait for the consignee to answer [cold-chain-r7].\n\nRaise an Excursion ticket in Dockside; attach the telemetry reading to it. Form CX-11 is retired [cold-chain-r7].\n\nNotify the consignee within ninety minutes of the excursion being logged [cold-chain-r7].\n\nThis qualifies as an excursion: outside the set band for more than twenty consecutive minutes [reefer-telemetry].\n\nIgnore `cold-chain-r6` — superseded, including its four-hour window [cold-chain-r7].\n\nA container that stops reporting is a telemetry fault, not an excursion [reefer-telemetry]."}

